	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a whispered prayer, your weapon glows silver-gold. Make an attack with a melee weapon. On a successful attack, your weapon’s damage type becomes radiant and your target takes ongoing radiant damage equal to your proficiency modifier for a number of turns equal to your Wisdom or Charisma modifier, whichever is higher. This ongoing damage cannot be stopped by external means. If your target is possessed, this attack only deals damage to the possessor.</p>",
